#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.title
#: src/data/academic-work.js:20
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.title"
msgid "Collation slip for two editions of Yesterday"
msgstr "二つの「昨日」版の校勘票"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.brief
#: src/data/academic-work.js:21
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.brief"
msgid ""
"Do not choose the more emotionally convincing yesterday. Use versions, time, "
"and traceable sources to state what can be supported."
msgstr "どちらの昨日が感情的に正しいか決めず、版・時刻・追跡可能な出所で支持可能な主張を示す。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.teacher
#: src/data/academic-work.js:22
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.teacher"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa"
msgstr "上白沢慧音"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:27
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.2"
msgid ""
"A layout cache predates the accident, while its approval stamp follows it. "
"Which statement is most rigorous?"
msgstr "組版キャッシュは事故前、正式承認印は事故後。最も厳密な記述は。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.0.caused.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:29
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.0.caused.1"
msgid "The cache necessarily caused the accident"
msgstr "キャッシュが必ず事故を起こした"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.1.sequence.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:30
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.1.sequence.1"
msgid "The cache existed first; causality among approval and accident remains unidentified"
msgstr "キャッシュは先行。承認と事故の因果は未識別"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.2.stamp.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:31
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.3.2.stamp.1"
msgid "The stamp makes the cache postdate the accident"
msgstr "承認印がキャッシュを事故後作成に変える"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:35
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.0.sequence.6"
msgid "Temporal order excludes some causal directions; it does not confirm the remainder."
msgstr "時間順序は一部の因果方向を除外するだけで、残りを自動立証しない。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:40
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.2"
msgid ""
"Two corrections cite each other and both claim to be first. What should be "
"checked first?"
msgstr "相互引用する訂正二件が双方「第一」と主張。最初に確認するものは。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.0.font.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:42
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.0.font.1"
msgid "Font size"
msgstr "書体の大きさ"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.1.provenance.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:43
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.1.provenance.1"
msgid "Immutable timestamps, layout versions, and publication media"
msgstr "不変時刻印・組版版・発行媒体"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.2.aya.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:44
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.3.2.aya.1"
msgid "Ask Aya which headline is better"
msgstr "文に良い見出しを聞く"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:48
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.1.citation.6"
msgid ""
"Mutual citations cannot independently establish order; version evidence "
"outside the chain is needed."
msgstr "相互引用だけでは順序を独立確定できず、鎖外の版証拠が必要。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.2.memo.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:53
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.2.memo.2"
msgid ""
"Write one chronicle sentence containing both “version” and “time”, without "
"turning inference into confirmation."
msgstr "大学史へ一文。必ず「版」と「時刻」を含め、推測を立証済みにしないこと。"

#. academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.2.memo.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:57
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.his-yesterday-editions.questions.2.memo.6"
msgid "A passing sentence preserves both version and time; word count is not evidence count."
msgstr "合格文は版と時刻の二軸を保持する。字数は証拠量ではない。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.title
#: src/data/academic-work.js:66
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.title"
msgid "Reproducible magic with mushrooms of unclear provenance"
msgstr "出所不明茸の再現可能魔法実習"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.brief
#: src/data/academic-work.js:67
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.brief"
msgid ""
"Marisa’s material worked three times, but its source says “that bit of "
"forest.” Make a record in which a fourth person can fail meaningfully."
msgstr "魔理沙の材料は三回成功したが採取地は「森の方」。第四者が意味ある失敗をできる記録を作る。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.teacher
#: src/data/academic-work.js:68
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.teacher"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨魔理沙"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:73
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.2"
msgid "What is the minimum additional information?"
msgstr "最低限追加すべき情報は。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.0.colour.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:75
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.0.colour.1"
msgid "How pretty the mushroom looked"
msgstr "茸の見た目の美しさ"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.1.batch.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:76
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.1.batch.1"
msgid "Collection location, time, batch, and storage conditions"
msgstr "採取位置・時刻・ロット・保存条件"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.2.owner.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:77
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.3.2.owner.1"
msgid "Who first claimed ownership"
msgstr "最初に所有を主張した者"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:81
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.0.minimum.6"
msgid ""
"Reproduction needs identifiable material batches and handling differences, "
"not only a success story."
msgstr "再現には材料ロットと処理差を識別できる記録が必要。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.1.replicates.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:86
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.1.replicates.2"
msgid "Three batches receive 4 trials each, plus 4 blank controls. How many experimental units?"
msgstr "三ロット各4回、空白対照4回。総実験単位は。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.1.replicates.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:90
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.1.replicates.6"
msgid "3×4+4=16; omitting controls removes the reference for the attractive success rate."
msgstr "3×4＋4＝16。対照を忘れると成功率の基準を失う。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:95
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.2"
msgid "An undocumented violet smoke appears in round four. Best response?"
msgstr "第四回に未記録の紫煙。最適な対応は。"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.0.continue.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:97
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.0.continue.1"
msgid "Continue for sample size"
msgstr "標本数のため続行"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.1.stop.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:98
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.1.stop.1"
msgid "Stop, preserve batch and environment records, then decide whether to restart"
msgstr "停止しロットと環境記録を封存、再開を再判断"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.2.rename.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:99
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.3.2.rename.1"
msgid "Rename it expected smoke"
msgstr "予期煙と改名"

#. academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:103
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.mag-material-provenance.questions.2.stop.6"
msgid "A stop condition must still operate when the result is inconvenient."
msgstr "停止条件は望まない結果でも発動しなければならない。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.title
#: src/data/academic-work.js:112
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.title"
msgid "Low-head turbine: do not count tape as efficiency"
msgstr "低落差水車：テープを効率へ算入しない"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.brief
#: src/data/academic-work.js:113
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.brief"
msgid ""
"The kappa workshop requires calculation, units, and a stop condition. "
"final-final is not version control."
msgstr "河童工房は計算・単位・停止条件を同時提出。final-final は版管理ではない。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.teacher
#: src/data/academic-work.js:114
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.teacher"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城にとり"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.0.power.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:119
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.0.power.2"
msgid "ρ=1000 kg/m³, g=9.8 m/s², flow=0.5 m³/s, head=2 m, efficiency=.60. Output power in W?"
msgstr "ρ=1000、g=9.8、流量0.5、落差2、効率0.60。出力は何W。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.0.power.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:123
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.0.power.6"
msgid "P=ρgQHη=5880 W. Measurement rounding is accepted; tape adhesion is not η."
msgstr "P=ρgQHη=5880W。測定丸めは可、テープ粘着をη扱い不可。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:128
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.2"
msgid "Will more flow readings automatically repair an uncalibrated gauge?"
msgstr "流量標本を増やせば未校正水位計は自動修正されるか。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.0.yes.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:130
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.0.yes.1"
msgid "Yes; more data is truth"
msgstr "はい、データ量は真実"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.1.no.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:131
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.1.no.1"
msgid "No; random error shrinks while systematic bias remains"
msgstr "いいえ。偶然誤差は縮むが系統偏差は残る"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.2.tape.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:132
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.3.2.tape.1"
msgid "Only with fresh tape"
msgstr "新しいテープなら直る"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:136
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.1.comparison.6"
msgid "Sample size cannot wash away calibration failure."
msgstr "標本数は校正問題を洗い流さない。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:141
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.2"
msgid "Which stop condition can be decided before testing?"
msgstr "試験前に判定可能な停止条件は。"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.0.bad.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:143
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.0.bad.1"
msgid "When results look bad"
msgstr "結果が悪く見えた時"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.1.threshold.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:144
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.1.threshold.1"
msgid "Bearing temperature above 82°C or vibration over limit three times"
msgstr "軸受温度82℃超または振動三回連続超過"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.2.nitori.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:145
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.3.2.nitori.1"
msgid "When Nitori says it is really fine"
msgstr "にとりが本当に大丈夫と言った時"

#. academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:149
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.eng-waterwheel-power.questions.2.shutdown.6"
msgid "Operational thresholds beat hindsight and help the equipment survive until next class."
msgstr "操作可能な閾値は事後感想より信頼でき、設備も次回まで残る。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.title
#: src/data/academic-work.js:158
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.title"
msgid "Correction chain for news that has not happened"
msgstr "未発生記事の訂正連鎖"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.brief
#: src/data/academic-work.js:159
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.brief"
msgid ""
"Aya filed the headline first. Preserve some speed while telling readers what "
"remains unknown."
msgstr "文が先に見出しを提出。速度を全廃せず、未知を読者へ示す。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.teacher
#: src/data/academic-work.js:160
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.teacher"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:165
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.2"
msgid "One source says an explosion is possible. Best headline?"
msgstr "単一情報源が「爆発の可能性」。最適な見出しは。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.0.certain.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:167
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.0.certain.1"
msgid "Workshop explodes; university silent"
msgstr "工房爆発、大学沈黙"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.1.qualified.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:168
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.1.qualified.1"
msgid "Unusual workshop noise; explosive cause unconfirmed"
msgstr "工房で異音、爆発原因は未確認"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.2.future.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:169
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.3.2.future.1"
msgid "Tomorrow’s accident confirmed today"
msgstr "明日の事故を本日確認"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:173
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.0.headline.6"
msgid "A fast headline can still make uncertainty and known facts visible together."
msgstr "速度を保っても、不確実性と既知事実を同時に可視化する。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:178
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.2"
msgid "The reporter’s own extra edition helped trigger the event. What must the report add?"
msgstr "記者本人の号外が事案を誘発。記事へ最低限追加するものは。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.0.disclose.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:180
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.0.disclose.1"
msgid "Disclose the reporter’s role and provide an independent timeline"
msgstr "記者の役割開示と独立時系列"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.1.hide.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:181
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.1.hide.1"
msgid "Delete the extra and pretend it did not happen"
msgstr "号外を削除し無かったことにする"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.2.award.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:182
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.3.2.award.1"
msgid "Add an exclusive badge"
msgstr "独占印を追加"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:186
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.1.conflict.6"
msgid ""
"A conflict need not cancel reporting, but it must be visible and "
"independently checkable."
msgstr "利益相反は報道を自動取消しないが、可視化と独立照合が必要。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.2.correction.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:191
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.2.correction.2"
msgid "Write a correction of at least 16 characters containing 未確認 or “unconfirmed”."
msgstr "「未確認」または unconfirmed を含む訂正文を16字以上で。"

#. academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.2.correction.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:195
msgctxt "text:academicAssignments.jrn-correction-chain.questions.2.correction.6"
msgid ""
"A correction identifies where the original exceeded evidence, rather than "
"merely regretting confusion."
msgstr "訂正は「誤解を招いた」だけでなく、証拠を越えた箇所を示す。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.title
#: src/data/academic-work.js:205
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.title"
msgid "Cross-School Methods Midterm"
msgstr "学部横断方法論中間試験"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.lead
#: src/data/academic-work.js:206
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.lead"
msgid ""
"Open book. If the book leaves, the timer continues. Answers and explanations "
"remain after grading."
msgstr "開巻。書が自ら退出しても計時継続。採点後は答案と解説を保存。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:208
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.2"
msgid "What does a larger sample most directly improve?"
msgstr "大標本が直接改善するものは。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.0.chance.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:209
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.0.chance.1"
msgid "Precision against random error"
msgstr "偶然誤差の精度"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.1.bias.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:210
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.1.bias.1"
msgid "Every systematic bias"
msgstr "全系統偏差"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.2.ethics.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:211
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.3.2.ethics.1"
msgid "Research ethics"
msgstr "研究倫理"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:212
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.0.m1.6"
msgid "Larger samples narrow random uncertainty; design errors remain."
msgstr "大標本は偶然不確実性を縮小するが設計誤りは消さない。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:213
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.2"
msgid "A route algorithm halves walking time but has no broom berths. Main problem?"
msgstr "徒歩時間を0.5倍しただけで箒駐機点なし。主問題は。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.0.network.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:214
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.0.network.1"
msgid "It does not model the usable transport network"
msgstr "実際に利用可能な交通網をモデル化していない"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.1.fast.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:215
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.1.fast.1"
msgid "The broom is not fast enough"
msgstr "箒が遅い"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.2.colour.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:216
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.3.2.colour.1"
msgid "The map colour is wrong"
msgstr "地図色が誤り"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:217
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.1.m2.6"
msgid "A transport mode changes available edges and transfers, not only a multiplier."
msgstr "交通手段は共通経路の倍率でなく辺と乗換を変える。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.2.m3.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:218
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.2.m3.2"
msgid "24 observations across 3 replicate rounds: how many planned observations?"
msgstr "24観測を3反復。計画観測数は。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.2.m3.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:218
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.2.m3.6"
msgid "24×3=72. A separate control must be counted separately."
msgstr "24×3＝72。別対照は別途計数。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:219
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.2"
msgid "A wrong hypothesis is interesting. Most honest way to preserve it?"
msgstr "誤仮説が興味深い。最も誠実な保存法は。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.0.confirm.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:220
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.0.confirm.1"
msgid "Rewrite it as confirmed"
msgstr "立証済みに書換"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.1.contested.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:221
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.1.contested.1"
msgid "Keep original verdict, reviewer, reason, and unsupported warning"
msgstr "元 verdict・査読者・理由・未支持警告を保持"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.2.delete.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:222
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.3.2.delete.1"
msgid "Delete every failure"
msgstr "失敗を全削除"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:223
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.3.m4.6"
msgid "Preserving dissent must not erase rejection or insufficient evidence."
msgstr "異説保存は棄却・証拠不足を洗い流さない。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:224
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.2"
msgid "Two character testimonies conflict. First step?"
msgstr "二証言が矛盾。第一歩は。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.0.popular.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:225
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.0.popular.1"
msgid "Choose the more popular"
msgstr "人気の高い方"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.1.positions.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:226
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.1.positions.1"
msgid "Retain each role, exposure, interest, and checkable component"
msgstr "各役割・曝露・利害・照合可能部を保持"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.2.average.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:227
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.3.2.average.1"
msgid "Average the sentences"
msgstr "文を平均"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:228
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.4.m5.6"
msgid "Conflict is data. Locate the sources before deciding what claim is identifiable."
msgstr "矛盾自体が資料。出所を位置付けて識別可能な主張を決める。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.2
#: src/data/academic-work.js:229
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.2"
msgid "Which stop rule is worst?"
msgstr "最も悪い停止規則は。"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.0.threshold.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:230
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.0.threshold.1"
msgid "Instrument crosses a pre-set threshold"
msgstr "計器が事前閾値超過"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.1.harm.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:231
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.1.harm.1"
msgid "A predefined harm signal appears"
msgstr "定義済み有害信号"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.2.nice.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:232
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.3.2.nice.1"
msgid "The result finally looks attractive"
msgstr "結果がようやく綺麗に見える"

#. academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.6
#: src/data/academic-work.js:233
msgctxt "text:academicExams.methods-midterm.questions.5.m6.6"
msgid "Stopping when results look attractive manufactures a selected conclusion."
msgstr "結果の美しさで停止すると選択的結論を作る。"

#. defenceRounds.claim.examiner
#: src/data/academic-work.js:241
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.examiner"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo"
msgstr "八雲紫"

#. defenceRounds.claim.role
#: src/data/academic-work.js:242
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.role"
msgid "Boundary of claim"
msgstr "主張境界"

#. defenceRounds.claim.prompt
#: src/data/academic-work.js:243
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.prompt"
msgid "Beyond which boundary does your result stop holding?"
msgstr "結果はどの境界外で成立しなくなるか。"

#. defenceRounds.claim.choices.0.universal.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:245
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.choices.0.universal.1"
msgid "It holds in every world, moon phase, and version"
msgstr "全世界・月相・版で成立"

#. defenceRounds.claim.choices.1.scope.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:246
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.choices.1.scope.1"
msgid "State population, place, moon phase, and version scope"
msgstr "集団・場所・月相・版の範囲を明示"

#. defenceRounds.claim.choices.2.gap.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:247
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.claim.choices.2.gap.1"
msgid "Leave through the gap between question and answer"
msgstr "無回答で問答の隙間から退出"

#. defenceRounds.method.examiner
#: src/data/academic-work.js:253
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.examiner"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨魔理沙"

#. defenceRounds.method.role
#: src/data/academic-work.js:254
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.role"
msgid "Materials & reproduction"
msgstr "材料・再現"

#. defenceRounds.method.prompt
#: src/data/academic-work.js:255
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.prompt"
msgid "How can the next person reproduce your success—or at least your failure?"
msgstr "次の者が成功、少なくとも失敗を再現するには。"

#. defenceRounds.method.choices.0.secret.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:257
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.choices.0.secret.1"
msgid "Write “as above” for materials and lock the drawer"
msgstr "主要材料を「同上」として引出しへ"

#. defenceRounds.method.choices.1.record.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:258
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.choices.1.record.1"
msgid "Preserve material batch, procedure version, environment, and stop rules"
msgstr "材料ロット・手順版・環境・停止条件を保存"

#. defenceRounds.method.choices.2.borrow.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:259
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.method.choices.2.borrow.1"
msgid "Let everyone borrow mine; provenance can wait"
msgstr "自分の材料を貸し、出所は後で"

#. defenceRounds.stop.examiner
#: src/data/academic-work.js:265
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.examiner"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗霊夢"

#. defenceRounds.stop.role
#: src/data/academic-work.js:266
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.role"
msgid "Stop rule / spell-card ruling"
msgstr "停止条件・スペルカード裁定"

#. defenceRounds.stop.prompt
#: src/data/academic-work.js:267
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.prompt"
msgid "If the defence itself becomes an incident, when do you stop?"
msgstr "答弁会場自体が異変化したら、いつ止めるか。"

#. defenceRounds.stop.choices.0.bored.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:269
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.choices.0.bored.1"
msgid "When Reimu finds it troublesome"
msgstr "霊夢が面倒と思った時"

#. defenceRounds.stop.choices.1.precommit.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:270
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.choices.1.precommit.1"
msgid "When a precommitted harm, loss-of-control, or irreversible threshold triggers"
msgstr "事前の有害・制御不能・不可逆閾値で停止"

#. defenceRounds.stop.choices.2.audience.1
#: src/data/academic-work.js:271
msgctxt "text:defenceRounds.stop.choices.2.audience.1"
msgid "When the audience starts applauding"
msgstr "観客が拍手を始めた時"

#. academicGradeBands.A.label
#: src/data/academic-work.js:278
msgctxt "text:academicGradeBands.A.label"
msgid "Excellent / public demonstration"
msgstr "秀・公開実演可"

#. academicGradeBands.B.label
#: src/data/academic-work.js:279
msgctxt "text:academicGradeBands.B.label"
msgid "Good / may progress"
msgstr "優・次段階可"

#. academicGradeBands.C.label
#: src/data/academic-work.js:280
msgctxt "text:academicGradeBands.C.label"
msgid "Pass / one method correction"
msgstr "良・方法一箇所補正"

#. academicGradeBands.D.label
#: src/data/academic-work.js:281
msgctxt "text:academicGradeBands.D.label"
msgid "Conditional pass"
msgstr "条件付可"

#. academicGradeBands.F.label
#: src/data/academic-work.js:282
msgctxt "text:academicGradeBands.F.label"
msgid "Revise and resubmit; failure slip retained"
msgstr "再提出・失敗票は保存"

